# CMake and Gradle build output of this plugin. The libraries it copies into macos/, ios/ and android/ are what `factoria export`
# ships: commit them, or build them on the machine that exports.
/build/
/build-*/
.gradle/
.cxx/
# Google's iOS SDK (GoogleMobileAds.xcframework, UserMessagingPlatform.xcframework): a download under Google's license, copied in by
# `factoria call platform.add_backend '{"backend":"admob","sdk":"..."}'`. Never commit it: a clone downloads it again.
/ios/frameworks/
